 "description": "Commit (e) of the LUT color-management contract: the ACES and camera\nOEM color encodings, ported from the pinned sources only.\n\nCurves (TransferId, appended — ordinals pinned by LutInterpTest):\n- ACEScct (ACES CTL lib_ACES.util baked_param, pin 79688e5)\n- ARRI LogC3, SUP 3.x EI 800 (colour-science arri.py, pin 7ca0c87)\n- Sony S-Log3 (colour-science sony.py; decode derived, encode pinned)\n- Canon C-Log3 (Canon CSC CTL; decode derived, encode pinned)\n- Apple Log / Apple Log 2 — one shared curve (Apple CSC CTLs)\n- Panasonic V-Log (AVC-Intra white paper; decode derived)\n- Fujifilm F-Log (colour-science fuji.py; the pinned inverse verbatim)\n- Cineon (the pinned black-offset form)\n\nGamuts (GamutId, appended):\n- ACEScg (AP1 primaries, ACES ~D60 white; npm-derived)\n- ARRI Wide Gamut 3, S-Gamut3.Cine (pinned matrices, memcpy'd verbatim)\n- Canon Cinema Gamut, Apple Wide Gamut, V-Gamut (npm-derived",
